&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built for the &lt;strong&gt;Hacktoberfest Open-Source AI Challenge: Week 4 ("Ghost in the Machine")&lt;/strong&gt;, wrapping up on Halloween night as &lt;strong&gt;Día de los Muertos&lt;/strong&gt; begins (October 31 – November 2). Channeling the thin veil between past and present to honor our departed loved ones and the immortal spirits of computing who live on in every line of code we write.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

